{"name": "walkzzz/re-mbt", "version": "0.1.0", "description": "A port of ocaml-re \u2014 the pure OCaml regular expression library \u2014 to idiomatic MoonBit. Linear-time matching via lazy DFA with Brzozowski/Antimirov derivatives. Frontends: Perl, PCRE, POSIX, Emacs, Glob, Str.", "readme": "README.md", "license": "LGPL-2.1-or-later", "repository": "https://github.com/walkzzz/re-mbt", "keywords": ["regex", "regexp", "regular-expression", "ocaml-re", "port"], "deps": {"moonbitlang/x": "0.4.48"}, "checksum": "5db1e5f42e9ae152e12cec70632338fab31f32eb6a8ae05d27186d73cd9b9acb", "created_at": "2026-08-13T23:48:52.621897+00:00"}
